<h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
<p class="meta">UHM LandTech — Instagram Assistant ("Response Bot")<br>Last updated: November 18, 2026</p>

<p>This policy explains how UHM LandTech ("we", "us") handles information when you interact with our official Instagram account <strong>@uhm.uz</strong>, where an automated assistant replies to comments and, in some cases, to direct messages.</p>

<h2>1. What information we process</h2>
<ul>
  <li>Your Instagram username and Instagram-scoped user ID</li>
  <li>The text of comments you leave on our posts, and the ID of the post you commented on</li>
  <li>Messages exchanged with our account, when the assistant sends you a private reply to your comment or answers a direct message</li>
  <li>Contact details you choose to give us in a conversation: your name, phone number, and the machine or equipment you are interested in</li>
</ul>
<p>We do not collect your password, contacts, location, or any information from your private profile. We only receive what Instagram sends us about interactions with our own account.</p>

<h2>2. Why we use it</h2>
<ul>
  <li>To reply to your comments and questions (for example, about prices, availability, or services)</li>
  <li>To send you more details by private message when you ask about our products</li>
  <li>To forward complaints or complex requests to our staff so a person can follow up</li>
  <li>To prevent duplicate replies and hide spam or offensive comments</li>
</ul>

<h2>3. Automated processing</h2>
<p>Comment and message text is analysed by an AI service (Google Gemini API, paid tier) to understand what is being asked and to choose an appropriate reply. Under the terms of that paid service, the data is not used to train Google's models. No decisions with legal or similarly significant effects are made automatically.</p>

<h2>4. Who we share it with</h2>
<ul>
  <li><strong>Meta Platforms</strong> — which operates Instagram and delivers comments and messages to us</li>
  <li><strong>Google</strong> — as the AI processing provider described above</li>
  <li><strong>Our staff</strong> — who may receive a notification about your comment or request so they can help you</li>
</ul>
<p>We do not sell your information and do not use it for advertising.</p>

<h2>5. How long we keep it</h2>
<p>We keep comment records and message history for up to <strong>90 days</strong> to provide replies and follow up on requests, after which they are deleted. Contact details you give us (name, phone number, equipment of interest) are kept as a customer request record so our sales team can contact you and keep a history of your enquiries; they are kept until you ask us to delete them. We also keep summary statistics (for example, the number of comments per day) that do not identify you. Content on Instagram itself (your comments and messages) remains under Instagram's control and can be deleted by you at any time.</p>

<h2>6. Your rights and data deletion</h2>
<p>You can ask us to show or delete any information we hold about you. To request deletion, send a message to <strong>@uhm.uz</strong> on Instagram or email us at the address below, including your Instagram username. We will delete your data within <strong>30 days</strong> and confirm when it is done.</p>
<p>You can also remove our access at any time by deleting your comments or messages on Instagram.</p>

<h2>7. Contact</h2>
<p>UHM LandTech<br>Email: <a href="mailto:uhmlandtechuz@gmail.com">uhmlandtechuz@gmail.com</a><br>Instagram: <a href="https://www.instagram.com/uhm.uz/">@uhm.uz</a></p>

<h2>8. Changes</h2>
<p>We may update this policy. The date at the top shows the latest version.</p>
</section>

